  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  enabled: 1
  lines:
  - '* SMELL DANGER RATING'
  - '* Snow Smell - Snowman\n  WHITE Rating\n  Can become <color=#FFFF00FF>YELLOW</color> Rating'
  - '* Unsuspicious Smell - Puppy\n  <color=#0000FFFF>BLUE</color> Rating\n  Smell of rolling around.'
  - '* Weird Smell - Humans\n  <color=#FF0000FF>GREEN</color> Rating\n  Destroy at all costs!'
  sounds:
  - snd_text
  speed: 00000000
  portraits:
  - 
  remarks: []
  secondaryLines: 1
  lines2:
  - '* Okay,^05 so what if instead\n  of fighting whoever\n  these weirdos are...'
  - '* We talk them out of\n  fighting us.'
  - '* They seem like they''d\n  be normal enough to\n  actually TALK to.'
  - '* I can''t really see that\n  happening,^05 but I guess\n  it''s worth a try...?'
  sounds2:
  - snd_txtsus
  - snd_txtsus
  - snd_txtsus
  - snd_txtnoe
  speed2: 00000000
  portraits2:
  - su_smile_sweat
  - su_smile
  - su_smile_sweat
  - no_happy
  remarks2: []
  vanishAtFlag: -1
  vanishAtCount: 0
  triggerFlag: -1
  forceSecondaryAtFlag: -1
  talkSprites: []
  talkFramerate: 6
